s que simboliza la paz y la renovación. La casa de invitados ofrece comodidad y privacidad para los visitantes. Villa ‌TrueLove ‌es ‌mucho ‌más ‌que ‌una vivienda: ‌es un ‌santuario único donde el lujo ‌se ‌une ‌al ‌significado, ‌diseñado para quienes buscan ‌equilibrio, ‌privacidad ‌y ‌conexión ‌con ‌la ‌naturaleza.","en":"Villa TrueLove is a six-bedroom, five-bathroom luxury villa in the heart of Benahavís. It offers stunning mountain and garden views, combining modern technology with natural design. The home features a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living, surrounded by lush gardens and an infinity pool. Every detail reflects elegance and peace, creating a private retreat for those who value space, beauty, and tranquility.\n\nInside, fine materials and craftsmanship define every room. The villa includes a designer kitchen with a sculptural island, a spacious living area that opens to the gardens, and two master suites with spa-like bathrooms. There is also a private gym, cinema room, and a wellness zone with a sauna, massage area, and a 1,500-year-old granite bathtub. Smart systems, solar panels, and advanced security make the property both beautiful and efficient.\n\nThe outdoor space is a haven of calm with a koi pond, a Bali temple, and a 1,000-year-old Algarrobo tree that symbolizes peace and renewal. A guest house offers comfort and privacy for ‌visitors. ‌Villa ‌TrueLove ‌is ‌more ‌than a ‌home—it is ‌a rare sanctuary where luxury ‌meets ‌meaning, ‌designed ‌for ‌those seeking a lifestyle ‌of ‌balance, ‌privacy, ‌and ‌connection ‌with ‌nature."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Sur","Excelente","Privada","Con Calefacción","Aire Acondicionado","Suelo Radiante","Montaña","Panorámicas","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","WiFi","Gimnasio","Sauna","Aprtmnt. Huéspedes","Trastero","Lavadero","Suelo de Madera","Doble acristala